  "title": {
   "en": "Okaa-sama no Iutoori!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "お母様の言うとおり！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“You are the villainess who will stand in the heroine’s way and meet a tragic end—Mimosa Southcross!”\n\nWith these shocking words, her mother reveals an unexpected truth—Mimosa is the villainess in a story destined for a tragic fate!\n\nHer mother, who possesses rare knowledge due to being reincarnated from another world, has foreseen her daughter’s dark future and decides to help her survive. And so, Mimosa’s life becomes a relentless struggle to avoid every trap that could lead to her doom.\n\nBut no matter how hard she tries, the fated day arrives—her mother passes away, just as written in the story, leaving Mimosa alone to face her impending fate!\n\nYet, she refuses to give up. She has memorized her mother’s teachings well. Now, she must confront the schemes of her stepmother and half-sister while avoiding the greatest threat to her life—her fated encounter with the second prince, Alcor Astralis!\n\nArmed with her mother’s records on the events of this “Otome Game”, Mimosa embarks on a battle against destiny, determined to break every death flag that stands in her way!\n\nA unique fantasy novel that blends intelligent plotting, survival tactics, and a fierce heroine fighting to escape her doomed fate!"
  },
